{"schema":"faith-v5-management-minimum-iona-clarification-a02","machine_id":"4-8e1c2f1861","observed_at_utc":"2026-10-18T06:49:59.274057+00:00","source_head":"2c741ad29b6091087c3a2197145f5c17029af8ab","build_context":"1.20.0.4","game_root":"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Crusader Kings III\\game","admission_sha256":"791b184097adce3fb954829ec56c1e2d4d30b984cbbd5b2d649503b86e191a7a","new_live_evidence":false,"example_is_hypothetical":true,"state_observed":false,"native_legality":null,"action_ready":false,"sources":[{"id":"concepts","relative_path":"localization/simp_chinese/dlc/pam/pam_game_concepts_l_simp_chinese.yml","bytes":43748,"sha256":"930338fd47cf6495748b403bbded34eda444c7cfecce6ac02f0858c111f29c3b","spans":[{"start":2,"end":20,"lines":[{"line":2,"raw":" game_concept_puppet: \"傀儡\""},{"line":3,"raw":" game_concept_puppets: \"傀儡\""},{"line":4,"raw":" game_concept_puppeted: \"傀儡\""},{"line":5,"raw":" game_concept_puppeting: \"傀儡\""},{"line":6,"raw":" game_concept_puppet_type: \"傀儡类型\""},{"line":7,"raw":" game_concept_puppet_types: \"傀儡类型\""},{"line":8,"raw":" game_concept_puppet_type_desc: \"[puppet|e]始终拥有一个类型，该类型决定了他们可以代表你采取的行动。\\n\\n虽然他们的大部分特殊行动是共通的，但每种$game_concept_puppet_type$都有仅限该类型使用的独特行动。\\n\\n比如，一个[clerical_puppet|e]可以代表你将某人[excommunicate|e]，而一个[external_ruler_puppet|e]可以被迫释放[tributary|e]，或是和自己的[spouse|e]离婚。\\n\\n你每种类型最多只能拥有一个$game_concept_puppet$。\""},{"line":9,"raw":" game_concept_puppet_desc: \"傀儡是受[puppeteer|E]控制，可借其执行特殊傀儡行动的[character|E]。\\n\\n通过傀儡行动，可开启原本关闭的门径：[clerical_puppet|E]可代你请求[clerical_titles|E]或[excommunication|E]，而[external_ruler_puppet|E]可受命释放[tributaries|E]、给予独立或与其配偶[spouse|E]。\\n\\n可用行动由[puppet_type|E]决定。\""},{"line":10,"raw":" game_concept_puppeteer: \"操纵者\""},{"line":11,"raw":" game_concept_puppeteers: \"操纵者\""},{"line":12,"raw":" game_concept_puppeteer_possessive: \"操纵者\""},{"line":13,"raw":" game_concept_puppeteers_possessive: \"操纵者\""},{"line":14,"raw":" game_concept_puppeteer_desc: \"操纵者是控制着一个或多个[puppets|E]的[character|E]。\\n\\n通过傀儡行事，操纵者可行使自身所不具备的权力，例如[clergy|E]的影响力或另一[realm|E]的权威。\""},{"line":15,"raw":" game_concept_clerical_puppet: \"领地司祭傀儡\""},{"line":16,"raw":" game_concept_clerical_puppets: \"领地祭司傀儡\""},{"line":17,"raw":" game_concept_clerical_puppet_desc: \"作为自己[liege|E]的[puppet|E]的[realm_priest|E]。\\n\\n操纵者可以通过其插手[faith|E]事务：向[head_of_faith|E]请愿[clerical_titles|E]或[excommunication|E]、管理[holy_sites|E]、建立新的[rite|E]，或是举办[ecumenical_council|E]。\""},{"line":18,"raw":" game_concept_external_clerical_puppet: \"神职统治者傀儡\""},{"line":19,"raw":" game_concept_external_clerical_puppets: \"神职统治者傀儡\""},{"line":20,"raw":" game_concept_external_clerical_puppet_desc: \"成为另一位[ruler|E][puppet|E]的有权势的[clergy|E]——[archbishop|E]，甚至于[head_of_faith|E]。\\n\\n该神职人员的地位越高，其影响力就越广：一个被操纵的信仰领袖可以代表你对敌人进行[excommunicate|E]、任命[cardinals|E]、授予[pressed_claim|E]，或是发起一场[holy_war|E]。\""}]}]},{"id":"interaction_labels","relative_path":"localization/simp_chinese/dlc/pam/pam_character_interactions_l_simp_chinese.yml","bytes":256030,"sha256":"1f8fecbfa9c3435d6db6d90b423bf1047d3b9f20c9095d45c4b51d8b3c5cff46","spans":[{"start":571,"end":574,"lines":[{"line":571,"raw":" make_clerical_puppet_interaction: \"傀儡领地司祭\""},{"line":572,"raw":" make_clerical_puppet_interaction_extra_icon: \"$hook_extra_icon$\""},{"line":573,"raw":" make_clerical_puppet_interaction_desc: \"让你的[court_chaplain|E]成为你的[clerical_puppet|E]，这使你可以通过[recipient.GetHerHim]进行[interactions|E]\""},{"line":574,"raw":" make_clerical_puppet_interaction_notification: \"[recipient.GetShortUINameNoTooltip]成为你的傀儡\""}]},{"start":579,"end":582,"lines":[{"line":579,"raw":" make_external_clerical_puppet_interaction: \"傀儡神职统治者\""},{"line":580,"raw":" make_external_clerical_puppet_interaction_extra_icon: \"$hook_extra_icon$\""},{"line":581,"raw":" make_external_clerical_puppet_interaction_desc: \"[puppet|E]你的[realm|E]外的一名[clergy|E]\""},{"line":582,"raw":" make_external_clerical_puppet_interaction_notification: \"[recipient.GetShortUINameNoTooltip]成为你的傀儡\""}]}]},{"i